{"id":"dal_she","lemma":"дальше","pos":"adv","rank":259,"glosses":["furthermore","then; next; afterwards"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/2d/Ru-%D0%B4%D0%B0%D0%BB%D1%8C%D1%88%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D0%B4%D0%B0%D0%BB%D1%8C%D1%88%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Скажи мне, что мне делать дальше.","en":"Tell me what I should do next.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1267619","words":[{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"сказать"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"to make, to do"},null]},{"text":"Куда мы дальше пойдём?","en":"Where do we go next?","words":[{"g":"where?"},{"g":"we"},null,{"g":"to go","l":"пойти"}]},{"text":"Скажите мне, куда идти дальше.","en":"Tell me where to go next.","words":[{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"сказать"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"where?"},{"g":"to go"},null]},{"text":"Я хочу знать, что делать дальше.","en":"I want to know what to do next.","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"to make, to do"},null],"phrases":[[0,3,"I want to know"]]},{"text":"Пожалуйста, скажите нам, что делать дальше.","en":"Please tell us what to do next.","words":[{"g":"please"},{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"сказать"},{"g":"(to) us","l":"мы"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"to make, to do"},null]}]}